<title>POLAND: KREDYT BANK TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 7.5.</title>
<headline>KREDYT BANK TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 7.5.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 400,000 shares in Kredyt Bank SA at 7.5 zlotys per share was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Friday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Kredyt Bank traded at 7.7 zlotys in a volume of 81,032 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
